{
  "title": "Call of the Night",
  "description": "One sleepless night, Ko slips out to walk the streets. Life after dark is a revelation! When flirtatious Nazuna invites Ko to spend the night at her place in an abandoned building, he’s stoked! But then he awakens to kisses on his neck with a little too much bite to them... Is it just the delicious taste of his blood that makes her meet him night after night for late-night adventures, conversation and...naps? Or something else? Then, when a cute girl from Ko’s past shows up and competes for his attention, his budding relationship with the undead is put to the test! \n\n(Source: VIZ Media) \n\n*Notes:\n\\- Seventh place of Tsugimanga 2020 Award in the Manga Category and first place of Daruma 2023 Award (France) in the new manga category (released in 2022 in France).\n\\- Includes three extra chapters.*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Comedy, Depression, Detectives, Drama, Female Lead Falls in Love First, Female Protagonist, Inconclusive Ending, Lesbian Character, LGBTQ+ Characters, Love Triangle, Middle School Student, NEET, Open Ending, Outdoor Activities, Philosophy, Primarily Teen Cast, Psychological, Romance, Slice of Life, Slow Romance, Supernatural, Surreal Comedy, Unresolved Romance, Urban, Young Protagonist, Adapted to Anime, Award Winning, Awkward at Relationships, Bored Protagonist, Coming of Age, Crimes, Easily Embarrassed Female Lead, Eccentric Female Lead, Fantasy, Female Lead, Fights, Friendless Character, Friendship, Gyaru, Heterosexual, Hikikomori, Important Non-Romantic Relationship, Insomnia, Interspecies Relationship, Iyashikei, Loneliness, Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Master-Servant Relationship, Monster Girls, Nightlife, Non-human, Non-Human Protagonist, Obsessive Love, Older Female Younger Male, Shota, Shounen, Urban Fantasy, Vampires, Weak to Strong, Braid",
  "artist": "Kotoyama",
